{"dossier":"D16","entry_points":[{"sids":["drivers/block/virtio_blk.c::virtblk_setup_cmd","drivers/block/virtio_blk.c::virtblk_fail_to_queue","drivers/block/virtio_blk.c::id_table","drivers/block/virtio_blk.c::virtio_blk_init"],"text":"Setup maps read, write, flush, discard, zero and zone with append trailer, rejecting unknown; failures kick and unwind; driver claims block class and links probe, remove and power ops."},{"sids":["drivers/char/virtio_console.c::port_fops_read","drivers/char/virtio_console.c::port_fops_write","drivers/char/virtio_console.c::virtcons_probe","drivers/char/virtio_console.c::virtcons_remove"],"text":"File read sleeps freezably then delivers with disconnect and nonblocking rules; write caps and submits; probe registers, validates, creates queues and publishes; interrupts schedule work."},{"sids":["drivers/net/virtio_net.c::virtnet_poll","drivers/net/virtio_net.c::start_xmit","drivers/net/virtio_net.c::virtnet_open","drivers/net/virtio_net.c::virtnet_set_rx_mode"],"text":"Arrival schedules NAPI; receive disables callbacks, reclaims and ingests to budget; transmit picks queue, builds descriptors and notifies; open prefills, enables pairs and sets carrier."}],"exports":[{"sids":["drivers/virtio/virtio_ring.c::virtqueue_add_sgs","drivers/virtio/virtio_ring.c::virtqueue_get_buf","drivers/virtio/virtio_ring.c::virtqueue_kick","drivers/virtio/virtio_ring.c::virtqueue_add_outbuf"],"text":"Virtqueue API submits scatter lists and inbound buffers, retrieves completions with optional context, controls callbacks with prepare and poll, and prepares or issues notifications."},{"sids":["include/linux/virtio_config.h::virtio_cread","include/linux/virtio_config.h::virtio_find_vqs","include/linux/virtio_config.h::virtio_device_ready","drivers/virtio/virtio_ring.c::virtio_max_dma_size"],"text":"Config offers typed reads gated by features, byte writes and queue discovery; setup publishes driver-ready with sync; DMA sizing follows custom hooks or parent when map