io_blk.c::virtblk_poll","drivers/char/virtio_console.c::port_has_data","drivers/char/virtio_console.c::control_work_handler"],"text":"Device mutex guards late removal paths with per-queue spinlocks; console input guard covers cached data and presence while control work holds queue lock only to fetch or return buffers."},{"sids":["drivers/net/virtio_net.c::virtnet_send_command_reply","drivers/virtio/virtio.c::__virtio_config_changed","drivers/tty/hvc/hvc_console.c::__hvc_poll","drivers/net/virtio_net.c::virtnet_poll_cleantx"],"text":"Net control commands serialize under mutex, config changes under IRQ spinlock, programs under RCU and stats under sequence lock; HVC instance lock covers drain and poll with drops."}],"pass":1,"phase_map":[{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p14","crown":"A","phase":"F0"},{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p04","crown":"A","phase":"F2"}],"schema":"lx.dossier.v1","state_machines":[{"sids":["drivers/block/virtio_blk.c::virtblk_prep_rq","drivers/block/virtio_blk.c::virtio_queue_rq","drivers/block/virtio_blk.c::virtblk_probe","drivers/block/virtio_blk.c::virtblk_remove"],"text":"Requests go setup, map, locked enqueue, notify outside, drain with suppress and rearm to release; probe builds resources then driver-ready; remove quiesces, resets and clears."},{"sids":["drivers/char/virtio_console.c::port_fops_open","drivers/char/virtio_console.c::port_fops_release","drivers/char/virtio_console.c::remove_port","drivers/char/virtio_console.c::unplug_port"],"text":"Open rejects missing, console or busy then announces open; release announces close and discards; ports go create, prime, publish to operation then unplug, reclaim and free."},{"sids":["drivers/net/virtio_net.c::receive_small","drivers/net/virtio_net.c::receive_mergeable","drivers/net/virtio_net.c::virtnet_xdp_handler","drivers/net/virtio_net.c::virtnet_close"],"text":"Small, big and mergeable paths validate, run programs with pass, transmit, redirect or drop, then recycle; close suppresses callback